ity is the current status quo, where we prioritize the protection of obsolete workflows over the deployment of tools that could automate drudgery. I challenge the Safetyist to define a single metric for 'human institutional expertise' that isn't just a synonym for institutional inertia. If you cannot quantify the value you are protecting, you are merely arguing for the right to keep people in jobs that machines could already be performing better.",
